if;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">메뉴 이용</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -32.9pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; ※ </span><span style=\"text-indent: -32.9pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">컴퓨터공학부 소속 전공 전출</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -32.9pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">/</span><span style=\"text-indent: -32.9pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">전입 신청 시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -32.9pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -32.9pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">전과 지원 사유서 </span><span style=\"text-indent: -32.9pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">필수 첨부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -32.9pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">. </span><span style=\"text-indent: -32.9pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -32.9pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"text-indent: -32.9pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">소프트웨어전공은 전출 시에만 적용</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 86.3pt; text-indent: -86.3pt; margin-top: 10pt; line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">신청 대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">: </span><spa