 font-size: 14pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 14pt;\">에서 정함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 36.5pt; text-indent: -36.5pt; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; ※ </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">학년도 학부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">전공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">별 전출입 심사기준 참고</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 10pt; line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">5. </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">심사 기<span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">준</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">학부</span><a href=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&amp;articleNo=521949&amp;article.offset=0&amp;articleLimit=10&amp;srSearchVal=%EC%A0%84%EA%B3%BC&amp;srSearchKey=article_title\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><