; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; ※ </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">심사일정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: 2026-2</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">학기 성적 확정 즉시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">학부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">전공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">별 일정에 따라 전출</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">‧</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">전입 심사 진행</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 10pt; line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">6. </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">전과 확정일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">: 2026. 1. 21.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">) [</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">예정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">]</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 10pt; line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">7. </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">참고 사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 35.4pt; text-indent: -35.4pt; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">전과 신청에는 성적 기준 없음</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">학부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">전공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">별 전출입 심사 시 학업성적 등 자체 기준 있음</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 36.6pt; text-indent: -36.6pt; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">전과한 자는 전입 학과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">전공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">의 교육과정을 따르며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">전입 학과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">전공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">전체 학년 교육과정</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">의 필수과목을 모두 이수하여야 함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">  </span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 10pt; text-align: center; wor